{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50724","headline":"赠薛鼎臣侍御 · 张祜","name":"赠薛鼎臣侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子清明致自强，大寮佥语美公方。\n长才上拔孤摽日，利劒新磨一匣霜。\n千里早时知逸足，片言中夜许刚肠。\n已知金石终无变，应蓄归休在智囊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}